 "comments": [
  {
   "rating": 19,
   "date": "2007-03-16T08:20:31-05:00",
   "body": "To beging this chain you must \nfirst:\nFind Tara Thenysil in Astranaar who will give you a quest to go to stone tallon\n\nsecond:\ndo all the quests of Gaxim rust fizzle\nthe final quest he has you do requites you to talk to Kaela Shadowspear giving you 2 quest\nsprtis and ancients this chain leads to the final\nquest giving 500 Rep to all faction Alliance",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 16,
   "date": "2005-10-21T03:32:31-05:00",
   "body": "random drop from any tree-like creatures in the charred vale.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 12,
   "date": "2007-02-07T15:32:31-06:00",
   "body": "The [b]Charred Vale[/b] is located at [b]Loc: 33,68[/b] in [b]Stonetalon Mountains[/b].\n\nMake sure you take a few other quests for the same location meanwhile.\n\nI got my quest item on the first kill.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 8,
   "date": "2007-05-19T04:30:07-05:00",
   "body": "I found the drop on a blackened ancient at the very southern end of the charred value in stonetalon mountains.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 7,
   "date": "2007-03-31T04:14:09-05:00",
   "body": "Treants are the tree-like mobs. They roam around The Charred Vale.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2005-11-26T15:32:31-06:00",
   "body": "this took about 20 kills for me to get, not bad. It was the tree things.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2006-01-02T03:32:31-06:00",
   "body": "I was lucky in that I found the corroded parts on my third kill. I went on to kill two more treants, just on general principles and because they seem to have a longer aggro range than a lot of other mobs, particularly the 27 and 28 treants in Western Ashenvale. Nasty buggers who will sneak up on you when you least expect it.\n\nMy 25 Druid got 2300XP and 25 Silver; not bad for this level of diffficulty.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2006-08-09T03:32:31-05:00",
   "body": "She's got nothing for me, I can't even talk to her ... do I have to do all the Gaxim quests first?",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2006-09-14T15:32:31-05:00",
   "body": "Yes, you should do it first.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2007-05-16T03:32:31-05:00",
   "body": "Maybe the person who said the drop rate is lower if you are higher level is right, I was doing the quest when everything was grey to me and probably killed about 10 or 15 before I finally got the item from a silver elite treant in the Charred Vale.&nbsp; Can't remember what they were called.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2004-12-22T18:54:18-06:00",
   "body": "Killed a number of trees to get the drop. Finally got it off a level 28 one, as did my hunting partner. It may be the lower level ones (level 25, 26) don't drop the shrapnel.",
   "replies": [
    "I found it on about my 10th kill.  For me it dropped from a lvl 25 Ancient (I think it was a \"blackened ancient\").",
    "Where are the ancients at?",
    "Ok you can kill the 26's also i just did it as a 29 hunter very very very easy.  got it on the third one.",
    "Well i found them in charred vale south of stone... peak."
   ]
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2006-07-03T15:32:31-05:00",
   "body": "think that the lower yr lvl when u do this - the more likely you will get it quickly.\n\nquest was gray for me by the time i got around to doing it and i don't know how many i've killed so far w/o a drop.&nbsp; :P",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2006-06-14T18:13:46-05:00",
   "body": "The quest item dropped off the first Blackened Ancient I killed.  I was in the process of doing the Reclaiming the Charred Vale quest when I got the drop.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2007-04-09T16:01:19-05:00",
   "body": "Uh is Thenysil \"Sentinel Thenysil\"? Or is there a Tara Thenysil? If the sentinel is right I cant talk to her! can some1 help me",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2005-12-20T05:19:06-06:00",
   "body": "Along with doing 'Enraged Spirits' this unlocks\n'Update for Sentinel Thenysil'\n\nsee that quest for the conclusion of the thread",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2007-03-10T19:57:49-06:00",
   "body": "Low drop rate, be prepared to kill a lot of these. I got my drop from a Charred Ancient, probably the 10th or so I killed. I imagine that any of the Ancients will do. There are a bunch of them in the middle of Charred Vale but they also wander to the southern edge (approx 28,70 to 38,70) - easier if you can't pull them because they are level 27ish and you don't want to aggro too many.\n\nI would do this quest with Enraged Spirits (fire elementals), Reclaiming the Charred Vale (harpies),and Retrieval for Mauren (basilisks)\nI am a level 29 Dwarf Paladin - not too much trouble solo but only 2 at a time at most...",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2007-02-11T02:31:05-06:00",
   "body": "Got the drop from a 'Charred Ancient'.  Third one I killed and it actually attacked me because I thought I needed a 'Blackened Ancient', so I was skulking around looking for one when the 'Charred' attacked me and bingo, go the drop.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2006-12-01T17:42:37-06:00",
   "body": "Anyone know or have coordinates for quest giver, cant find anywhere",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2007-01-05T19:56:01-06:00",
   "body": "They must come from Blackened Ancients. The quest level IS 28 and none of the Charred Ancients go up to that level. I killed a single Blackened Ancient (with the help of a Horde) and I got the quest item quick.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": -1,
   "date": "2005-06-17T23:08:49-05:00",
   "body": "I got this quest together with \"Enraged Spirits\" at the same time.",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
